  "version": "0.8.0-alpha.1",
  "notes": "## 0.8.0-alpha.1 - 2026-05-11\n\n### Features\n\n- Linux Wayland desktops now get more reliable clipboard change detection and clipboard sync.\n- Files and images sent from mobile devices now show live receiving progress in the dashboard.\n\n### Fixes\n\n- Pasting invitation codes with a hyphen no longer drops the final character.\n- Saving automatic history cleanup rules in Storage settings no longer fails.\n- Restarting after network or mobile sync setting changes is more reliable and avoids port conflicts.\n- Mobile file and image transfers now show their receiving and completed states in the right order.\n- Documentation welcome-page quick links no longer open broken pages.\n\n<!-- zh -->\n\n## 0.8.0-alpha.1 - 2026-05-11\n\n### Features\n\n- Linux Wayland 桌面的剪贴板变化检测和剪贴板同步更加可靠。\n- 移动端发送的文件和图片现在会在仪表盘显示实时接收进度。\n\n### Fixes\n\n- 粘贴带连字符的邀请码时，不会再丢失最后一个字符。\n- 存储设置中的自动清理历史规则现在可以正常保存，不再失败。\n- 修改网络或移动同步设置后重启更加可靠，避免新旧进程抢占端口。\n- 移动端文件和图片传输现在会按正确顺序显示接收中和已完成状态。\n- 文档欢迎页的快捷链接不再打开错误页面。",
